bin/
obj/
*.user
.vs/

# Downloaded third-party installer artifacts — never commit binaries pulled from
# an external site; docs/virtual-audio-decision.md explains how to fetch them again.
tools/vbcable/

# Generated test audio/output and machine-readable reports — reproducible via
# `dotnet run --project tools/VTTranslate.LiveTest -- gen-test-audio` /
# `pipeline-test`, not meant to be committed.
test-results/

# Never committed, never should exist here — the app reads the Azure key only from
# environment variables (see docs/architecture.md, AppSettings.cs), but this is a
# hard backstop in case anyone ever creates one of these by hand.
appsettings.local.json
*.env
.env
